@imphil and I have been playing around a bit with the Ibex example recently. We believe this is going to be very useful for security hardening. When experimenting, we noted some issues. Especially around the interplay with more recent tool versions.

This PR contains some fixes for that. I suggest to review the individual commits separately, they are all pretty small. If you don't agree with some of the patches, I am happy to factor out/remove stuff. Just let me know.

What? Fix exhibits modal in correction
Why? Modals are not showing correctly.
How? Call the correct component in the exhibits modal.
How to test? Do the complete exhibits flow, as student, corrector and student again.
Student should submit a cbe;
Admin should correct it and return to student;
Student should see the correction feedback;

In all of those steps, you should see the correct exhibits list.

